---
// Architecture diagram — the same shape as the README block, as inline SVG
// with hairline strokes.
//
// `source.sjon` and `Ast.Tree` carry accent fills so the eye lands on the two
// canonical pieces first; everything else stays monochrome. Every colour is a
// Starlight token, so the diagram follows the theme toggle with the rest of
// the page — an SVG with baked-in fills would go on being a light-mode diagram
// on a dark page.
---

<figure class="pipeline">
    <svg
        viewBox="0 0 600 340"
        role="img"
        aria-label="SJON pipeline: source.sjon to Lexer to Parser to Ast.Tree to Printer, Validator, Expr, JSON, Binary, and Edit."
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
    >
        <g
            stroke="var(--sl-color-gray-3)"
            fill="none"
            stroke-width="1"
            font-family="var(--__sl-font)"
            font-size="14"
            font-weight="500"
        >
            <rect x="240" y="14" width="120" height="32" rx="4" fill="var(--sl-color-accent)" />
            <text x="300" y="35" text-anchor="middle" stroke="none" fill="var(--sl-color-white)">source.sjon</text>

            <path d="M300 46 L300 72" />

            <rect x="240" y="72" width="120" height="32" rx="4" fill="var(--sl-color-bg-nav)" />
            <text x="300" y="93" text-anchor="middle" stroke="none" fill="var(--sl-color-text)">Lexer</text>

            <path d="M300 104 L300 128" />

            <rect x="240" y="128" width="120" height="32" rx="4" fill="var(--sl-color-bg-nav)" />
            <text x="300" y="149" text-anchor="middle" stroke="none" fill="var(--sl-color-text)">Parser</text>

            <path d="M300 160 L300 188" />

            <rect x="220" y="188" width="160" height="40" rx="4" stroke-width="1.5" fill="var(--sl-color-accent-low)" stroke="var(--sl-color-accent)" />
            <text x="300" y="213" text-anchor="middle" stroke="none" fill="var(--sl-color-white)" font-weight="600">Ast.Tree</text>

            <path d="M300 228 L300 264" />
            <path d="M75 264 L525 264" />

            <path d="M75 264 L75 280" />
            <path d="M165 264 L165 280" />
            <path d="M255 264 L255 280" />
            <path d="M345 264 L345 280" />
            <path d="M435 264 L435 280" />
            <path d="M525 264 L525 280" />

            <rect x="35" y="280" width="80" height="32" rx="4" fill="var(--sl-color-bg-nav)" />
            <text x="75" y="301" text-anchor="middle" stroke="none" fill="var(--sl-color-text)">Printer</text>

            <rect x="125" y="280" width="80" height="32" rx="4" fill="var(--sl-color-bg-nav)" />
            <text x="165" y="301" text-anchor="middle" stroke="none" fill="var(--sl-color-text)">Validator</text>

            <rect x="215" y="280" width="80" height="32" rx="4" fill="var(--sl-color-bg-nav)" />
            <text x="255" y="301" text-anchor="middle" stroke="none" fill="var(--sl-color-text)">Expr</text>

            <rect x="305" y="280" width="80" height="32" rx="4" fill="var(--sl-color-bg-nav)" />
            <text x="345" y="301" text-anchor="middle" stroke="none" fill="var(--sl-color-text)">JSON</text>

            <rect x="395" y="280" width="80" height="32" rx="4" fill="var(--sl-color-bg-nav)" />
            <text x="435" y="301" text-anchor="middle" stroke="none" fill="var(--sl-color-text)">Binary</text>

            <rect x="485" y="280" width="80" height="32" rx="4" fill="var(--sl-color-bg-nav)" />
            <text x="525" y="301" text-anchor="middle" stroke="none" fill="var(--sl-color-text)">Edit</text>
        </g>
    </svg>
    <figcaption>
        Lexer and parser on the way in, one <code>Ast.Tree</code> in the
        middle, six consumers reading it.
    </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
    .pipeline {
        margin: 1.5rem 0;
        border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline-light);
        border-radius: 0.5rem;
        padding: 1rem;
    }
    .pipeline svg {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: block;
    }
    .pipeline figcaption {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
        color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
        max-width: 56ch;
        margin: 1rem auto 0;
    }
</style>
